BEGIN:VEVENT
SUMMARY:Once Upon a Mattress
DTSTART:20261115T140000
DTEND:20261115T160000
DTSTAMP:20261119T193142Z
UID:8e3b9ae02fe9acde3580b9f0870e1e@vermont-events
DESCRIPTION:“Many moons ago in a far off place”…Prince Dauntless can
 not marry without his mother’s approval. And she has MANY thoughts about
  who is good enough for her baby boy. Meanwhile\, no one else in the kingd
 om is allowed to marry until Dauntless does\, and Lady Larken and Sir Harr
 y have a bit of a deadline coming up…! A desperate Sir Harry goes off on
  a princess quest and returns with a moat-swimming Princess Winnifred! (Sh
 e swam the moat?) Could a swamp princess be just what the kingdom has been
  waiting for? Join BarnArts in the round for this classic musical comedy k
 nown for kicking Carol Burnett into the high comedy spotlight as the stran
 ge but winsome Princess Winnifred! Every week through Nov 15\, 2026.\n\nSo
 urces: Vermont Public
LOCATION:Barnard Town Hall\, 115 North Rd.
URL:https://www.vermontpublic.org/vermont-events-calendar/event/once-upon-
 a-mattress-20-10-2026-14-03-09
END:VEVENT
BEGIN:VEVENT
SUMMARY:25th Anniversary Stuff-A-Truck / Pack the Pantry
DTSTART:20261119T050000
DTEND:20261119T230000
DTSTAMP:20261119T193142Z
UID:e7f6ced9e7364eed6259a98fd3aa76@vermont-events
DESCRIPTION:Celebrate 25 years of Stuff-A-Truck / Pack the Pantry\, a Cent
 ral Vermont tradition bringing neighbors together to help fight hunger! Fo
 r 25 years\, local families\, businesses\, schools\, first responders\, an
 d community organizations have come together to help ensure our neighbors 
 don't have to choose between food\, heat\, medicine\, and other necessitie
 s. This year's special anniversary celebration includes invitations to Ver
 mont Governor Phil Scott\, the 802 Ghostbusters\, Santa Claus\, and other 
 community guests. Guest appearances are subject to confirmation. The event
  is free and open to the public. Stop by\, bring non-perishable food donat
 ions\, and help us FILL THE TRUCK! Event information: www.vtpackthepantry.
 com\n\nSources: Vermont Public
LOCATION:Pack The Pantry`\, 168 Ames Drive
URL:https://www.vermontpublic.org/vermont-events-calendar/event/25th-anniv
 ersary-stuff-a-truck-pack-the-pantry-19-10-2026-21-38-03
END:VEVENT
