DESCRIPTION:Bring the whole family for a lively evening of music and danci
 ng! In the tradition of New England barn dances\, a friendly caller will t
 each each dance as we go\, with simple circles\, squares\, longways sets\,
  and play-party-games for all ages. No experience—and no partner—neede
 d. What are FlynnZone Family Nights? Every third Thursday\, join us at the
  Flynn for FREE evenings of hands-on arts experiences designed for the who
 le family to learn\, create\, and explore together. Each session features 
 engaging classes or workshops led by local and visiting artists\, offering
  a fun and welcoming space to connect and grow through creativity. Artist 
 Group Info Mary Wesley mary@marywesley.com https://www.marywesley.com/ 153
  Main St. Burlington \, Vermont 05401 802-652-4500 https://www.flynnvt.org
