BEGIN:VEVENT
SUMMARY:Hug Your Farmer: The Last Waltz Revisited
DTSTART:20261120T193000
DTEND:20261120T223000
DTSTAMP:20261119T193142Z
UID:9586fe2bd2ff04876e8c2481c9ab22@vermont-events
DESCRIPTION:This year’s Hug Your Farmer celebrates the 50th anniversary 
 of The Last Waltz\, The Band’s legendary farewell concert and one of the
  most beloved moments in American music history. An all-star lineup of Ver
 mont musicians and special guests to revisit the songs\, spirit\, and comm
 unal magic of that classic night. Expect a joyful\, genre-spanning tribute
  filled with rock and roll\, roots\, soul\, folk\, gospel\, blues\, and Am
 ericana — the music that shaped The Band and continues to inspire genera
 tions. Now in its 16th year\, Select’s music benefit series has raised m
 ore than $1 million for local Vermont farming initiatives. In the last thr
 ee years alone\, Hug Your Farmer concerts have raised more than $500\,000 
 for the Vermont Community Foundation’s farming initiatives. Along the wa
 y\, Hug Your Farmer has become one of Vermont’s great annual musical tra
 ditions: a night when artists\, audiences and community come together in c
 elebration and support of the farmers who sustain our state.\n\nSources: V
 ermont Public
LOCATION:The Flynn\, 153 Main St.
URL:https://www.vermontpublic.org/vermont-events-calendar/event/hug-your-f
 armer-the-last-waltz-revisited-29-07-2026-15-06-21
END:VEVENT
