DESCRIPTION:OMIGOD YOU GUYS! Harvard’s beloved blonde\, Elle Woods\, is 
 taking the stage in "Legally Blonde: The Musical\," a high-energy pop come
 dy about staying true to yourself. When Elle’s boyfriend dumps her for s
 omeone "serious\," she hits the books and heads to Harvard Law School to w
 in him back\, only to discover her own true potential along the way. Packe
 d with explosive dance numbers\, infectious songs\, and a whole lot of pin
 k\, this feel-good\, empowering show is a must-see for the whole family! (
 Rated PG-13 for mild language and mature humor). With 100+ students workin
 g on the show\, this promises to be another great show with large dance nu
 mbers\, as well as great costumes\, songs and humor. We hope to see you at
  the show. Tickets: $15 Adult/$12 Seniors and Children under 12\n\nSources
 : Vermont Public
LOCATION:Mount Abraham Union High School\, 220 Airport Drive
